name    mod-kill-collector: completing a list grants its achievement
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Needs KillCollector.AchievementsEnable = 1 and the module's
# achievement_dbc rows on the server; the client shows the achievement once it has the patch-9 rows.
#
# The smallest list on the workbench: "Oddities of the Forgotten Land" (achievement 30050) = the three
# creatures of no known kind that Azealia (map 727) spawns - Poisonous Mushroom (30435), Void Stone (86123),
# Enchanted Zol'maz weapon (86156). The director kills each with `.damage` while the mage stands next to it
# in the party, so the mage collects through the group's kill reward. After the third creature the list is
# complete; `.killcollector status` counts the achievement for the Forgotten Land. That the character holds
# 30050 is checked in `character_achievement` after the run (bots save at logout).
# Each creature is respawned by the director (`.respawn` on the picked one, which replaces the object, so
# it is picked again) before its kill: the scenario runs again while an earlier run's corpse still lies there.
timeout 180s

bot a mage
group party

place 727 13392.6 11411.4 -148.5
require a alive
do gm target a
as gm .killcollector reset
expect output has "collection reset"

log 1 - Poisonous Mushroom
pick m creature:30435 near a
do gm target m
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick m creature:30435 near a
require m alive
do a approach m
wait 1s
do gm target m
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor m dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
as a .killcollector status
expect output has "1 different creatures killed"

log 2 - Void Stone
place 727 13711.4 11947.7 -49
pick v creature:86123 near a
do gm target v
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick v creature:86123 near a
require v alive
do a approach v
wait 1s
do gm target v
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor v dead timeout 5s
wait 1s

log 3 - Enchanted Zol'maz weapon completes the list
place 727 12044.3 11658.8 -85.3
pick w creature:86156 near a
do gm target w
as gm .respawn
wait 1s
pick w creature:86156 near a
require w alive
do a approach w
wait 1s
do gm target w
as gm .damage 1000000
waitfor w dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
as a .killcollector status
expect output has "3 different creatures killed"
expect output has "1 of 9 achievements"

cleanup
log kill collector achievement done
